{"id":"00555","root":"uni00555_1","name":{"ja":"眞田　咲","en":"Sanada Saki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"眞田　咲","en":"Sanada Saki"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2022-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":327,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者・ブレインフレーヤーによって別次元から連れてこられた未来の対魔忍。火遁の忍法に目覚め、対魔忍の里で忍術や体術を学んでいたが、あるとき、ブレインフレーヤー傘下の組織に単身で挑み返り討ちに遭ってしまう。里の仲間たちによって助けられたが、そのときに負った重傷のせいで忍法を上手く使えなくなってしまった。その代わりとして、彼女は新たに魔族の力と米連の科学技術を結集して作られた槍炎を手にする。槍炎は彼女の対魔粒子に反応して人工的な火遁を発動させ、さらに魔族の力を使用することで炎遁による豪炎を放つ。","en":"She is a Taimanin from the future, brought to this world by the dimension invader Brain Flayer. She awoke to the fire-based ninja art of Katon and studied ninjutsu and martial arts at the Taimanin village. However, when she single-handedly challenged a Brain Flayer-affiliated organization, she was defeated and left with severe injuries that rendered her unable to use her ninja arts properly. As a replacement, she wields a new spear, the Spear Flame, which is a fusion of demon powers and science from the US. The Spear Flame reacts to her anti-demon particles to activate artificial Katon, and by utilizing demon powers, it can unleash a massive flame through the art of Enton."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"柚原みう","forms":[{"id":"uni00555_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[824,1648],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[141,282],"def":[87,174],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","1360009"]},{"id":"uni00555_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1248,2496],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[232,464],"def":[124,248],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","1360009","1360010"]},{"id":"uni00555_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1672,3346],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[323,645],"def":[161,323],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","1360009","1360010"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{